321	    /**
322	     * The region derived from this owner's postcode alone: the region whose fixed
323	     * {@linkplain #REGION_POSTCODE_RANGE postcode range} contains the postcode, or {@code null}
324	     * when the postcode is absent, not four digits, or in no known range. This is the {@code <REGION>}
325	     * component built into the owner's customer code at creation and, through it, the source of the
326	     * owner's {@linkplain #getLocality() locality}. It is the single place a region is read from an
327	     * owner's postcode, so every rule keyed by the postcode-derived region shares one derivation.
328	     */
329	    public String getRegion() {
